WEBVTT

01:27.140 --> 01:29.980
<b>AQUARION</b>

01:32.900 --> 01:35.470
The melody of Naacal has been disrupted.

01:35.900 --> 01:38.370
The chaos is infectious.

01:38.720 --> 01:41.190
As soon as you find those 
with defiled wings,

01:41.830 --> 01:45.800
tear out their wings and 
banish them from Naacal!

01:45.800 --> 01:49.820
That alone will not be enough to 
restore Mulua Satene's powers.

01:51.030 --> 01:55.510
If the goddess's powers do not return, 
Soma will continue to wither.

01:56.130 --> 02:00.560
What should we do, priest of 
the star of judgment, Sukuna?

02:01.610 --> 02:04.220
Create a new god.

02:07.820 --> 02:11.070
Create... a god, you say?

02:11.350 --> 02:14.040
I have created a new god.

02:14.600 --> 02:16.430
The mechanical angel.

02:17.580 --> 02:19.790
When did this happen?

02:19.790 --> 02:22.940
Maluku, priest of light, 
were you aware of this?

02:26.740 --> 02:29.700
We can only pray that the 
goddess will not be outraged.

02:30.270 --> 02:33.770
Sedona, Haida, from now on you 
are forbidden from speaking

02:33.770 --> 02:35.750
with members of the priest of light's house.

02:35.750 --> 02:37.080
We are leaving.

02:40.220 --> 02:42.180
Yes, Father.

02:43.380 --> 02:44.590
Sister?

02:54.400 --> 02:56.520
Nanook the Coward.

02:57.030 --> 03:01.040
To think that you were the child 
of the priest of sunlight.

03:12.690 --> 03:16.260
Do you no longer speak to 
members of an enemy house?

03:20.300 --> 03:24.520
The sun and moon are fated to 
never rise in the same sky.

03:24.800 --> 03:30.850
Even if those heavenly bodies cannot rise in 
the same sky, they are still bound by mana

03:31.210 --> 03:33.820
and remain drawn to each 
other as the days pass.

03:36.210 --> 03:41.740
Like the sun and moon before us, 
we too shall take a vow of mana.

04:00.310 --> 04:03.870
<i>Now we can share our feelings 
without using our voices.</i>

04:04.940 --> 04:07.530
<i>Does this mean we are not defying orders?</i>

04:28.890 --> 04:32.040
It cannot be. 
The wings of that man and wife?

04:32.040 --> 04:34.990
This is what you wished for, Haida.

04:34.990 --> 04:35.960
What?

04:36.640 --> 04:42.340
It cannot simply be because I said, 
"if only those children had wings."

04:46.920 --> 04:49.930
The stains are disappearing.

04:49.930 --> 04:53.330
It is the proof that they have no emotion.

04:53.330 --> 04:58.080
I will pray for you. That you are not 
destroyed by your own curiosity.

04:58.440 --> 05:02.690
We angels elevated each other's 
mana through our wings

05:02.690 --> 05:06.370
and established this advanced spiritual 
space civilization of Naacal.

05:06.850 --> 05:10.740
But our overflowing emotions led 
to chaos and disrupted order.

05:11.500 --> 05:15.950
What Naacal requires now is 
our ability to tune the mana

05:15.950 --> 05:19.660
and children like these 
who have no emotions.

05:24.740 --> 05:27.440
I know what you are thinking.

05:33.500 --> 05:36.860
<i>This will be our secret alone.</i>

06:16.520 --> 06:18.810
Huh? What is that?

06:25.060 --> 06:27.530
I-It's a monster!

06:32.330 --> 06:33.330
Help!

06:38.740 --> 06:40.720
Have you seen it?

06:41.450 --> 06:46.840
The Mechanical Angel attracted the wrath of 
the goddess and now a monster has appeared!

06:46.840 --> 06:51.870
Or perhaps it is due to the fact that we 
have not offered our new god enough mana yet.

06:51.870 --> 06:57.990
Goddess Mulua Satene, please teach us 
how we might regain your blessing.

07:03.650 --> 07:05.830
Take a maiden to the fountain of Soma?

07:05.830 --> 07:07.520
To join the goddess?

07:07.840 --> 07:11.990
Do you wish us to bring a new 
maiden to join the goddess?

07:19.430 --> 07:23.080
Does this mean Sedona will become a goddess?

07:23.080 --> 07:24.280
Ridiculous!

07:24.570 --> 07:28.660
Rejoice! Our daughter will join the goddess!

07:29.020 --> 07:30.460
Sister...

07:30.460 --> 07:34.820
<i>My dear baby sister Haida, do not be sad.</i>

07:35.200 --> 07:38.880
<i>When I become a goddess, I will 
be able to watch over you always.</i>

07:39.910 --> 07:44.670
But then what happens with you and that man?

07:57.880 --> 07:59.640
Haida, Haida.

08:00.470 --> 08:02.500
Sukuna, Haida came.

08:04.280 --> 08:06.170
Did you learn to talk?

08:06.170 --> 08:10.360
They can only repeat words they 
have heard. They have no emotions.

08:10.880 --> 08:13.070
More importantly, why are you here?

08:15.720 --> 08:18.370
You don't want Sedona to become a goddess.

08:20.020 --> 08:26.720
My sister and Nanook, the son 
of the sun priest, are in love.

08:30.510 --> 08:34.310
This medicine can add some color to wings.

08:34.650 --> 08:36.620
Give this to Sedona to drink.

08:37.430 --> 08:40.070
Add color to wings?

08:40.620 --> 08:42.380
I will show that I notice,

08:42.800 --> 08:46.400
and after I then raise an objection 
over her defiled wings,

08:46.400 --> 08:49.580
the decision for Sedona to join 
the goddess will be rescinded.

08:51.230 --> 08:55.780
Do not worry. Over time, the natural 
color of her wings will return.

08:55.780 --> 08:58.730
But then who will join the goddess?

08:59.130 --> 09:02.050
There is no shortage of replacements.

09:06.140 --> 09:07.190
Well?

09:25.820 --> 09:27.000
Sedona.

09:29.570 --> 09:33.110
<i>This is the last time we will 
be able to share our thoughts.</i>

09:33.110 --> 09:36.180
We cannot be certain that light 
represents the will of the goddess.

09:36.700 --> 09:39.960
<i>Be happy for me. I will become a goddess.</i>

09:39.960 --> 09:43.270
Do you understand what that means? 
If you become one with the goddess,

09:43.610 --> 09:47.480
your own body and emotions will disappear.

09:47.840 --> 09:52.320
<i>If I refuse, somebody else will have 
to become a goddess in my stead.</i>

09:54.780 --> 09:57.680
Such goddesses should be 
eliminated once and for all.

09:58.120 --> 10:00.080
How can you say such a horrible thing?

10:03.210 --> 10:08.370
I have never felt a stronger passion to 
overcome my cowardice than I do now.

10:10.720 --> 10:12.840
Nanook the Coward,

10:14.580 --> 10:16.790
that is your virtue.

10:27.090 --> 10:30.610
Surely the idea that the endless destruction 
is caused by the mechanical angel,

10:33.410 --> 10:36.820
and that this demon 
extracts mana from people

10:36.820 --> 10:42.290
and amplifies malignant mana to 
create monsters are mere rumors.

10:43.280 --> 10:44.860
All falsehoods.

10:46.560 --> 10:49.590
Monsters are born of chaos.

10:49.590 --> 10:52.740
That is the exact opposite of the 
mechanical god I have created.

10:52.740 --> 10:54.760
There is yet another rumor.

10:55.660 --> 11:00.000
That the priest of the star of judgment, 
using his sinister devices,

11:00.000 --> 11:05.180
has gathered wingless ones from outside 
of Naacal and given them defiled wings.

11:06.090 --> 11:09.530
Might that be the true cause 
of the goddess's rage?

11:10.550 --> 11:16.980
What if there was another individual who had 
truly blasphemed the goddess before me?

11:16.980 --> 11:17.950
Hm?

11:26.350 --> 11:28.720
Twelve thousand years from now...

11:29.240 --> 11:32.300
I know we will meet here again.

11:45.150 --> 11:48.500
So this is what they saw in mythic space?

11:48.500 --> 11:51.720
Enoshima is sucking the 
mana out of mythic space.

11:51.720 --> 11:57.230
It's DEAVA. It's from the stake 
that she placed in mythic space.

11:57.230 --> 12:02.230
Well, the only things capable of meddling in 
other universes are bioquantum computers.

12:02.230 --> 12:05.240
That's why we built that thing.

12:05.240 --> 12:09.740
But the things he saw will affect 
his motivation in battle.

12:10.350 --> 12:12.740
It might be a bad idea to 
put him back in Aquarion.

12:13.100 --> 12:16.830
Munakata-sensei, you'll be 
responsible for their tuning.

12:19.790 --> 12:22.770
That kid was a real double-edged sword.

12:23.180 --> 12:27.630
But thanks to the child of the holy egg,
we now have more Elements.

12:27.630 --> 12:34.020
As things stand, our universe has a 
97 percent chance of winning.

12:34.400 --> 12:37.970
But that leaves a three percent 
chance of uncertainty.

12:38.620 --> 12:40.410
We'll deal with things as they occur.

12:40.410 --> 12:44.650
Even if all beings with flesh and emotions 
disappear, the information remains.

12:45.460 --> 12:48.070
That's what the HAKOBUNE is for, after all.

12:49.390 --> 12:52.670
What are these emotional tuning 
programs about anyway?

12:53.380 --> 12:56.340
We can't pilot in Aquarion 
until we complete them.

12:56.340 --> 12:58.490
Kinda feels like it's been taken from us.

12:58.490 --> 13:02.350
Not really. That thing 
wasn't ours to begin with.

13:02.350 --> 13:06.080
Are you really cool with losing the 
emotions you finally regained?

13:06.080 --> 13:08.960
Didn't you say you thought they might 
come back if you get in Aquarion?

13:08.960 --> 13:10.720
It's just a feeling I had.

13:11.440 --> 13:15.160
Our universe has totally 
changed too, hasn't it?

13:15.700 --> 13:16.630
Yeah.

13:17.760 --> 13:19.500
Even the school.

13:20.360 --> 13:23.350
I can't believe three 
whole months passed here.

13:23.350 --> 13:26.090
Since open battle began with the Mythic Beasts,

13:23.360 --> 13:28.370
Closed Due
to Evacuation

13:26.090 --> 13:28.360
it's like the whole world is at war.

13:28.360 --> 13:31.950
The mana from mythic space 
mixed with the mana here,

13:31.950 --> 13:34.550
and it's like the two universes 
are pulling at each other.

13:34.550 --> 13:36.630
Almost like snakes.

13:36.630 --> 13:38.030
Or a double helix.

13:38.030 --> 13:38.960
Huh?

13:39.690 --> 13:42.080
I guess they really are going to unite.

13:42.950 --> 13:46.630
The moment they unite, disruptions 
in the symmetry will mean that

13:46.630 --> 13:52.900
the universe with even a tiny advantage will 
win and the losing side will disappear.

13:53.370 --> 13:55.430
And that's what's happening now.

13:55.930 --> 14:00.150
We have to tune our emotions and 
fight in solidarity to the finish.

14:00.490 --> 14:04.040
Hey, that thing we saw...

14:04.790 --> 14:05.720
Yeah.

14:06.140 --> 14:08.980
I guess that means we set things in motion.

14:09.290 --> 14:13.960
Our precious emotions still 
exist in that place.

14:14.490 --> 14:16.070
I don't want them to disappear.

14:16.900 --> 14:18.930
I'm going to see Sun.

14:18.930 --> 14:19.360
What?

14:19.360 --> 14:19.930
Huh?

14:19.930 --> 14:21.880
I'm going to stop the 
universes from uniting.

14:21.880 --> 14:23.010
Huh?

14:23.010 --> 14:24.390
Remember what the masks said?

14:24.760 --> 14:27.720
Unity is the will of 
the child of the holy egg.

14:27.720 --> 14:31.170
And if that's Sun-kun, he must know 
some way to stop them from uniting!

14:31.170 --> 14:32.180
Do you think so?

14:32.570 --> 14:35.840
Well, it's possible. Maybe he can.

14:38.750 --> 14:41.200
What do you mean you won't let us see him?

14:41.200 --> 14:42.660
Those are the rules.

14:42.660 --> 14:45.270
You can't see the student council president 
without the vice president's permission.

14:45.270 --> 14:46.770
So who is the vice president?

14:46.770 --> 14:48.440
It's Hatano-san.

14:48.740 --> 14:49.720
Toshi?

14:51.080 --> 14:52.110
Toshi-kun!

14:52.110 --> 14:54.540
You guys can't see Sun-kun.

14:54.540 --> 14:55.780
Why not, Toshi?

14:55.780 --> 15:00.710
In order to defeat mythic space, he has 
to concentrate on tuning this universe.

15:00.710 --> 15:04.030
Also, there are people who are 
trying to kidnap him right now.

15:04.030 --> 15:05.030
Why are people after him—

15:04.680 --> 15:06.550
So would you mind leaving?

15:06.850 --> 15:08.050
I'm really busy right now.

15:08.050 --> 15:08.980
What?!

15:12.030 --> 15:15.220
Damn it. What the heck is up with Toshi?

15:17.250 --> 15:18.800
Vice Principal!

15:21.650 --> 15:25.190
Vice Principal, we really 
need to see Sun-kun.

15:25.190 --> 15:27.320
Is there anything you can do to help?

15:27.320 --> 15:31.130
There's no use. 
I can't disobey Hatano-kun either.

15:31.130 --> 15:32.140
Why not?

15:32.140 --> 15:35.500
Hatano-kun has awakened 
and advanced a stage.

15:35.500 --> 15:36.650
A stage?

15:36.650 --> 15:38.140
In the ceremony.

15:47.820 --> 15:50.830
After he made Sun-kun 
student council president,

15:50.830 --> 15:54.530
he borrowed his powers and started 
awakening the students left and right.

15:54.530 --> 15:55.750
Awakening?

15:55.750 --> 15:57.490
From the way they describe it,

15:57.490 --> 16:01.140
only those who have destroyed
the shell of the old order

16:01.140 --> 16:05.800
and passed through the gates of chaos 
can attain a higher quality union.

16:07.090 --> 16:11.140
Vice Principal, have you heard 
of the World Awakening Council?

16:12.280 --> 16:14.130
How did you know about that?

16:16.590 --> 16:20.410
The Awakening Council is 
a group of world leaders.

16:20.690 --> 16:24.910
They are the ones who built the 
Space Preservation Agency and this school.

16:24.910 --> 16:27.740
Hatano-kun was selected 
by the Awakening Council

16:27.740 --> 16:31.420
and now has even more 
authority than the faculty.

16:31.420 --> 16:34.170
So this is where you've been, Vice Principal.

16:34.960 --> 16:36.460
Munakata-sensei!

16:36.460 --> 16:38.680
May I have a word with you?

16:40.220 --> 16:44.860
What in the world could you 
possibly want with me now?

16:48.050 --> 16:49.950
It's another rift, near Kamakura!

16:49.950 --> 16:50.880
That's close!

16:53.380 --> 16:56.170
Senpai. Momohime-senpai!

16:56.170 --> 16:57.100
Hey!

16:59.440 --> 17:03.750
I'm so glad you're alive!

17:05.380 --> 17:06.660
Hana-chan.

17:07.270 --> 17:09.410
Momohime-senpai.

17:10.870 --> 17:14.960
Oh. Sakko-senpai. And Rimiya-senpai.

17:15.340 --> 17:17.260
Huh? We're just extras?

17:17.530 --> 17:22.600
Don't worry. I'm not going to die 
until you kill me, Hana-chan.

17:22.600 --> 17:24.260
I promised, didn't I?

17:24.260 --> 17:25.190
Yeah.

17:33.950 --> 17:34.790
Here we go!

17:34.790 --> 17:35.710
All right!

18:02.380 --> 18:05.740
Pillar of Justice, Justitia's Sword!

18:05.100 --> 18:07.560
<b>Super Justice Goddess Sword</b>

18:13.650 --> 18:24.160
<b>Satela</b>

18:13.650 --> 18:24.160
<b>Kamakura</b>

18:13.650 --> 18:24.160
<b>Aquarion Naushizu Defeats Mythic Beast</b>

18:14.040 --> 18:17.950
<i>The Mythic Beast that appeared in 
Kamakura airspace this afternoon</i>

18:17.950 --> 18:22.310
<i>was successfully subdued by Enoshima 
Academy's Aquarion Naushizu.</i>

18:22.690 --> 18:27.170
<i>In addition, Elements around the world are 
participating in military training exercises</i>

18:27.170 --> 18:30.170
<i>and are continuing to tune 
their emotions toward victory.</i>

18:30.170 --> 18:33.770
<i>Meanwhile, there are also reports of a group 
called the Space Egg Council plotting</i>

18:30.170 --> 18:39.050
<b>Satela</b>

18:30.170 --> 18:39.050
<b>Enoshima</b>

18:30.170 --> 18:39.050
<b>Beware of the Space Egg Council</b>

18:33.770 --> 18:39.040
<i>to recapture student council president 
Sun-kun from the Element academy.</i>

18:39.040 --> 18:43.270
<i>To help combat the spread of misinformation, 
please watch this video message from Sun-kun.</i>

18:43.770 --> 18:50.350
<i>In order to assure an ideal tone at the 
time of union, I will tune the universe</i>

18:50.350 --> 18:54.970
<i>and ensure that all emotions 
become beautiful mana.</i>

18:54.970 --> 19:00.690
When you all went to that other universe, 
I didn't know what to do with myself.

19:00.940 --> 19:05.960
So I went to see Toshi-senpai, and then...

19:06.910 --> 19:11.200
When emotions resonate, they transmit mana.

19:11.910 --> 19:18.810
I didn't really get what it was for, 
but I decided to pray to it every day

19:19.110 --> 19:23.300
for all of you to come home 
safely, Momohime-senpai.

19:23.300 --> 19:25.330
And then yesterday...

19:25.330 --> 19:26.850
Momohime!

19:27.400 --> 19:31.230
For some reason, I heard 
Sakko-senpai's voice.

19:31.230 --> 19:35.180
After that, the egg flashed real bright.

19:36.570 --> 19:41.280
So you were the reason we were 
able to return, Hana-chan.

19:41.770 --> 19:45.560
I think Sakko-senpai was crying.

19:45.560 --> 19:47.780
Huh? Hell no I wasn't.

19:48.260 --> 19:50.690
While you were gone,

19:50.690 --> 19:55.640
Toshi-senpai said he would protect 
this universe instead of you

19:55.640 --> 19:58.250
and he got more and more carried away.

20:00.260 --> 20:04.240
If Toshi-senpai keeps it up, he's gonna die.

20:04.860 --> 20:07.750
Hana-chan, are you...

20:08.690 --> 20:09.620
Huh?

20:13.550 --> 20:18.000
Right then, it felt like mythic space's 
mana was giving us strength.

20:18.760 --> 20:22.440
All right, then. I'll go save Toshi-kun.

20:22.440 --> 20:24.200
Momohime-senpai.

20:24.200 --> 20:25.340
How are you gonna do that?

20:25.340 --> 20:30.710
I know! I'll finish those programs 
so I can pilot Aquarion again!

20:30.710 --> 20:34.870
And then I'll meet Sun-kun to talk, 
and we'll protect both universes!

20:35.710 --> 20:37.260
Don't worry!

20:37.260 --> 20:40.110
Once I'm in Aquarion, it'll all work out.

20:40.110 --> 20:41.710
Just leave everything to me!

20:43.320 --> 20:48.140
I really do like you tons, Momohime-senpai.

20:49.800 --> 20:53.380
So much I almost can't keep 
myself from killing you!

21:03.240 --> 21:04.400
You know what?

21:04.730 --> 21:05.800
What?

21:05.800 --> 21:11.300
To be totally honest, when we 
went to the other universe,

21:11.780 --> 21:15.630
all of the feelings I had lost came back.

21:15.630 --> 21:17.370
Why are you bringing this up now?

21:17.370 --> 21:22.150
So I thought I should try to say 
something while I had the chance.

21:22.150 --> 21:23.430
Huh?

21:24.040 --> 21:28.820
But then I left those 
feelings in that universe.

21:28.820 --> 21:31.880
So right now, I... I'm sorry.

21:32.730 --> 21:33.660
Sure.

21:34.580 --> 21:37.410
The sun and the moon, huh?

21:55.010 --> 21:56.340
Sakko!

21:56.730 --> 21:58.690
Rimiya? What the heck?

21:59.610 --> 22:02.740
She is... Momohime-neesama is...

22:02.740 --> 22:03.670
Hm?

22:04.230 --> 22:05.420
Dead.

22:05.790 --> 22:06.720
Huh?
